#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:-1
msgid "How you can support Krita's ongoing development."
msgstr "介绍如何支持 Krita 的存续和发展。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:10
msgid "SupportingKrita"
msgstr "SupportingKrita"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:15
msgid "Supporting Krita"
msgstr "如何支持 Krita 项目"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:17
msgid ""
"Krita is free, you don't need to purchase anything to use it. If you enjoy "
"Krita and want to support its continued development or work in a company "
"that relies on it, there are ways to support it though."
msgstr ""
"Krita 是免费软件，无需支付任何费用即可使用。如果你喜欢 Krita，并希望支持它的"
"存续和发展，或者你所在的公司依赖 Krita 开展业务，那么可以通过以下方式为 "
"Krita 项目提供支持。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:20
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "捐款"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:22
msgid ""
"Donating to Krita is the way that most of your money actually arrives. It "
"has the least amount of fees and less taxes."
msgstr ""
"直接捐款给 Krita 的手续费最少，缴税也更少，因此我们实际能收到的款项也最多，是"
"最有效的支持方式。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:24
msgid ""
"You can make regular, repeating donations via `the Krita Development Fund "
"<https://fund.krita.org/>`__. There is also an option for corporations and "
"other organizations to sponser Krita this way."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过 `the Krita 发展基金 <https://fund.krita.org/>`__ 提供定期捐款。企"
"业和其他组织也的赞助也可以通过定期形式进行。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:26
msgid ""
"For one-time donations, take a look at `the donation page on krita.org "
"<https://krita.org/en/donations/>`__. You can donate via credit card, "
"PayPal, bank transfer and other regional options."
msgstr ""
"您也可以在 Krita 官方网站的捐款页面进行 `单次捐款 <https://krita.org/zh-cn/"
"donations/>`__ 。支持信用卡、PayPal、银行转账和某些地域性捐款渠道。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:29
msgid "Purchases"
msgstr "购买产品"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:31
msgid "You can buy Krita on various online stores:"
msgstr "您可以在多个在线软件商店中购买 Krita 的付费版本来支持 Krita："

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:33
msgid "`Krita on Steam <https://store.steampowered.com/app/280680/Krita/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Krita 的 Steam 页面 <https://store.steampowered.com/app/280680/Krita/>`__"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:34
msgid "`Krita on the Epic Games Store <https://store.epicgames.com/p/krita>`__"
msgstr "`Krita 的 Epic 游戏商城页面 <https://store.epicgames.com/p/krita>`__"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:35
msgid ""
"`Krita on the Microsoft Store <https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/store/p/"
"krita/9n6x57zgrw96>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Krita 的 Microsoft Store 页面 <https://www.microsoft.com/zh-cn/store/p/"
"krita/9n6x57zgrw96>`__"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:36
msgid ""
"`Krita on the App Store for Mac <https://apps.apple.com/us/app/krita/"
"id1594607976?mt=12>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Krita 的 App Store Mac 专区页面 <https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/krita/"
"id1594607976?mt=12>`__"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:38
msgid ""
"If you purchase one these versions, you get auto-updates via the store you "
"purchased it from. Steam also gives you some cloud storage. The program "
"itself is the same, there are no features locked behind a paywall."
msgstr ""
"如果你购买了其中任意一个版本，即可通过购买时使用的软件商店平台获得自动更新。"
"Steam 还提供一定的云存储空间。程序本身与官网版本完全相同，没有任何功能被付费"
"墙限制。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:40
msgid ""
"You can also purchase some resource packs, training materials and more `on "
"the shop page on krita.org <https://krita.org/en/shop/>`__."
msgstr ""
"您还可以在 `Krita 官方网站的周边商店 <https://krita.org/zh-cn/shop/>`__ 中购"
"买各种资源包、教程培训资料以及其他产品来支持 Krita。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:45
msgid "Android Supporter Packs"
msgstr "安卓支持者权益包"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:47
msgid ""
"On Android, there are support options in the application itself through "
"Google Play. If you are using a device without Google services, they will "
"not be available. Development or nightly builds do not have them either."
msgstr ""
"安卓版 Krita 可通过 Google Play 在应用内获取支持选项。如果你使用的设备没有谷"
"歌服务，则无法使用这些功能。开发版或每日测试版同样不提供这些功能。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:49
msgid ""
"All supporter packs let you download resource bundles with brushes, "
"templates and more directly in the application. There is a subscription "
"available, which gives you access to all resource bundles. If you prefer not "
"entering into a subscription, there is also one-time purchase packs that "
"give you a fixed set of bundles instead."
msgstr ""
"所有支持者权益包均附赠可直接在应用内下载的资源包 (含笔刷、模板等)。您也可以订"
"阅 Krita 应用，解锁全部资源包；或选择一次性购买权益包，永久解锁指定组合的资源"
"包。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:51
msgid ""
"Subscriptions are managed through Google Play, you can unsubscribe or pause "
"your subscription there. Krita also provides links to manage your "
"subscription that send you directly to the right place in the Google Play "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Krita 的订阅通过 Google Play 管理，您可以在 Google Play 中取消或暂停订阅。"
"Krita 还提供了管理订阅的链接，可直接跳转至 Google Play 应用中的相应位置。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:53
msgid ""
"As with the versions of Krita you can buy on online stores, no features are "
"locked behind a subscription or purchase, you can still manually import "
"resource bundles. The supporter packs just provide some extra convenience."
msgstr ""
"安卓版与在线软件商店购买的 Krita 版本一样，没有任何功能需要订阅或付费才能使"
"用。你仍然可以手动导入上述资源包。支持者权益包仅提供一些额外的便利。"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:56
msgid "Commercial Support"
msgstr "商业支持和赞助"

#: ../../user_manual/supporting_krita.rst:58
msgid ""
"If your company or studio needs dedicated support or wants to sponsor the "
"development features or improvements to Krita, take a look at `the section "
"on development contracting on krita.org <https://krita.org/en/donations/"
"#development-contracting>`__"
msgstr ""
"如果您的公司或工作室需要专属支持，或希望赞助 Krita 的功能开发与改进，请查看 "
"Krita 官方网站的“开发合同”部分： `the section on development contracting on "
"krita.org <https://krita.org/zh-cn/donations/#development-contracting>`__ 。"
